          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_68",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_69",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_72",
        on: "branch_if_72",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "status_s15b",
            equals: "completed",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "say_smalltalk",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_73",
        on: "branch_if_73",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "status_s15b",
            not_equals: "completed",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Kaelor, who are you people? How did all these undead come to be here?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaelor",
            text: _("The hills to the north — now the home of my order — were once a wholly accursed place, blighted by necromancy and consumed by darkness."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaelor",
            text: _("We know not from whence the evil came. Some think the necromancers to be lich-lords, survivors of their invasion from the west; others believe they are stragglers of Ras-Tabahn’s. We only know that centuries ago, the crown used the ruby to seal them underground with powerful magic."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$speaker",
            text: _("Men and women of our order, servants of the light, have made it our mission to cleanse this place of evil. We built our monastery here to ensure that the darkness never escapes."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaelor",
            text: _("But it has been decades since the Crown sent to us men or supplies, and the power of our order has waned. Now the seals are beginning to fail..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_71",
